[{"text": "I now give the floor to His Excellency", "start": 1.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Vivian Balakrishnan,", "start": 5.44, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "Minister for Foreign Affairs of", "start": 8.08, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Singapore.", "start": 10.28, "duration": 2.92}, {"text": ">> Madam President, excellencies,", "start": 24.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "our world is undergoing a profound", "start": 28.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "disruption", "start": 30.68, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "characterized by great power", "start": 32.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "contestation, the wars in Ukraine, the", "start": 34.48, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "Middle East,", "start": 37.36, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "Africa.", "start": 38.84, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "We're witnessing the rise of trade", "start": 40.4, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "barriers,", "start": 41.96, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "supply chain disruptions,", "start": 43.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "worsening climate change, and a new", "start": 46.28, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "industrial revolution driven by digital", "start": 48.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "technologies, biotechnology,", "start": 51.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "and renewable energy.", "start": 54.36, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "This means", "start": 56.36, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "we face both great peril", "start": 57.76, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and great promise.", "start": 60.56, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "Yet,", "start": 62.64, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "we are in a more polarized and fractured", "start": 63.64, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "world.", "start": 66.08, "duration": 2.44}, {"text": "And one", "start": 67.2, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "that may be unable to protect the global", "start": 68.52, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "commons at precisely the moment that we", "start": 71.48, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "need that protection.", "start": 74.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Our interstate relations are", "start": 76.64, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "increasingly dictated by raw power,", "start": 79.2, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "where the outcomes are determined on the", "start": 83.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "basis of size, leverage, and coercion.", "start": 85.32, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "And this poses, obviously,", "start": 89.72, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "a clear and present danger for smaller", "start": 92.48, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "states like Singapore.", "start": 94.48, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "But,", "start": 97.64, "duration": 2.92}, {"text": "the point I wanted to make is that even", "start": 98.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the more powerful states", "start": 100.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "would ultimately pay a price because", "start": 103.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "hard power on its own cannot secure", "start": 105.76, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "supply chains, protect populations from", "start": 109.2, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "pandemics, or stabilize a warming", "start": 112.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "planet.", "start": 116.08, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "Even big powers need partners to secure", "start": 117.8, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "their long-term national interests.", "start": 121.88, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "The bilateral and regional arrangements", "start": 125.72, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "can complement global frameworks.", "start": 129.479, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "But on their own, they cannot replace", "start": 132.0, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "shared rules", "start": 134.52, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "that apply universally.", "start": 136.28, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "A system built", "start": 139.32, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "on individual coercive bargains would", "start": 141.76, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "inherently be more volatile and more", "start": 145.6, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "unstable.", "start": 148.76, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "And therefore, our thesis today is that", "start": 150.36, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 152.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "offers a different bargain. One that is", "start": 154.88, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "in every state's enlightened national", "start": 158.24, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "interest.", "start": 161.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "These shared rules and norms provide", "start": 162.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "predictability.", "start": 165.72, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "They constrain the capricious exercise", "start": 167.4, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "of power.", "start": 170.52, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "And they maximize autonomy even when", "start": 171.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "power is unequally distributed.", "start": 174.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Actually,", "start": 177.48, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "the multilateral system today still", "start": 178.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "works more often", "start": 181.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "than the headlines would suggest. A few", "start": 184.44, "duration": 5.799}, {"text": "examples. The World Food Program feeds", "start": 186.88, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "over a hundred million people a year.", "start": 190.239, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "The common ICAO standards enable a", "start": 194.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "hundred thousand flights to operate", "start": 198.4, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "safely every day.", "start": 201.48, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "With the ITU, our telecommunications", "start": 204.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "networks and the internet continues to", "start": 207.08, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "operate safely, smoothly on a planetary", "start": 209.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "scale.", "start": 213.6, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "The question is therefore not whether we", "start": 214.76, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "need multilateralism,", "start": 218.2, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "but how to make it fit for purpose.", "start": 220.48, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "And I suggest three priorities.", "start": 223.6, "duration": 4.359}, {"text": "First,", "start": 226.76, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "we all have to consistently comply with", "start": 227.959, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "international law.", "start": 231.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "And the norms of multilateralism.", "start": 233.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Second, we need to reform existing", "start": 237.04, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "institutions when needed. And third, we", "start": 239.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "need to collectively formulate new rules", "start": 243.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "and create new institutions", "start": 246.44, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "for new technologies.", "start": 248.52, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Let me deal with the first point.", "start": 250.84, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "The consistent compliance with", "start": 253.0, "duration": 4.519}, {"text": "international law.", "start": 255.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Consider UNCLOS, the UN Convention on", "start": 257.519, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "the Law of the Sea.", "start": 260.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "In fact, UNCLOS is one of the great", "start": 261.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "achievements of multilateral lawmaking.", "start": 264.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "It was concluded under the presidency of", "start": 268.32, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Professor Tommy Koh of Singapore,", "start": 270.64, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "who called it the constitution for the", "start": 272.96, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "oceans. For over four decades, it has", "start": 275.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "set out the legal framework for", "start": 279.04, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "activities in all our oceans and seas.", "start": 280.84, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "But the current war", "start": 285.48, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "in the Persian Gulf", "start": 288.36, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "has put UNCLOS to a severe stress test.", "start": 290.16, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "The Strait of Hormuz is closed.", "start": 294.24, "duration": 7.96}, {"text": "We have to collectively reject this.", "start": 297.84, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "Transit passage through straits used for", "start": 302.2, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "international navigation is a right", "start": 305.32, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "for all of us. It's not a privilege", "start": 308.4, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "subject to fees and tolls. And this is", "start": 311.84, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "customary international law, which means", "start": 315.52, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "it is binding on all states", "start": 318.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "whether or not they consider themselves", "start": 320.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "parties to UNCLOS.", "start": 322.56, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "How we deal with the Strait of Hormuz", "start": 325.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "will have implications for navigational", "start": 328.44, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "rights and freedom around the world.", "start": 330.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "At stake is the legal architecture for", "start": 334.16, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "freedom of navigation and overflight.", "start": 337.36, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "And we cannot allow any single country", "start": 340.84, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "to exercise a veto on these navigational", "start": 344.84, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "rights and freedoms.", "start": 347.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Beyond the legal and political", "start": 349.84, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "implications, the economic impact is", "start": 351.96, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "also very stark.", "start": 354.6, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "The Strait of Hormuz carried around a", "start": 356.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "fifth of the world's oil supplies, as", "start": 358.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "well as critical supplies for other", "start": 362.64, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "industries everywhere.", "start": 365.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Its disruption has meant higher energy", "start": 367.16, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "prices for all of us,", "start": 369.6, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "broken, disrupted supply chains, and", "start": 371.96, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "stranded seafarers. And this is why", "start": 375.08, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "shared rules like UNCLOS matter.", "start": 378.64, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "Defending them is not just a matter of", "start": 381.88, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "principle or debate.", "start": 384.12, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "It is in our collective interest.", "start": 386.8, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "The largest economies depend on the open", "start": 390.52, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "sea lanes as much as the smallest.", "start": 393.4, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "And we in Singapore hold ourselves to", "start": 397.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "the same standard. The Strait of", "start": 400.0, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "Singapore", "start": 402.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "is less than two nautical miles at its", "start": 403.56, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "narrowest.", "start": 407.2, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "And yet nearly a quarter of the world's", "start": 409.2, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "seaborne trade passes through the Strait", "start": 412.68, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "of Singapore.", "start": 416.36, "duration": 3.16}, {"text": "Singapore,", "start": 418.24, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Indonesia, and Malaysia, the three", "start": 419.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "littoral states of the Straits of", "start": 421.88, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "Malacca and Singapore,", "start": 423.84, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "have worked with other users of these", "start": 426.0, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "straits to keep the straits open,", "start": 428.2, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "secure, and accessible to everyone for", "start": 431.919, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "decades, including through the", "start": 435.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "cooperative mechanism on the safety of", "start": 438.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "navigation and environmental protection", "start": 441.36, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "in the Straits of Malacca and Singapore.", "start": 443.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Madam President, excellencies,", "start": 447.56, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "the second point is that we should and", "start": 450.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "must reform existing institutions and", "start": 453.2, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "processes where necessary.", "start": 456.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "In fact, free trade is another success", "start": 458.96, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "story of the post-war multilateralism.", "start": 461.92, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "Lower trade costs in these decades have", "start": 466.2, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "boosted global real GDP by an estimated", "start": 469.56, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "6.8%.", "start": 472.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "And in the case of low-income countries", "start": 475.2, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "by around 33%", "start": 478.72, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Under the GATT and subsequently the WTO,", "start": 482.2, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "disputes even between unequal powers", "start": 486.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "could be settled by adjudication rather", "start": 489.84, "duration": 5.079}, {"text": "than the exercise of unilateral", "start": 492.32, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "coercion.", "start": 494.919, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "But we all know the multilateral trading", "start": 496.56, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "system has frayed.", "start": 499.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "This year's WTO conference in Yaounde", "start": 501.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "could not even reach consensus on", "start": 505.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "several key issues including the", "start": 507.96, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "moratorium on the customs duties for", "start": 510.2, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "electronic transmissions which lapsed.", "start": 512.88, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "Tariffs and supply chain restrictions", "start": 516.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "have also returned as instruments of", "start": 519.0, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "coercion.", "start": 521.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "The consequences of all this cannot be", "start": 523.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "overstated.", "start": 526.28, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "For Singapore trade is three times our", "start": 528.16, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "GDP.", "start": 530.96, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "For many in this hall, access to markets", "start": 532.36, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "and technology are absolutely essential", "start": 535.44, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "for our development.", "start": 539.04, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "When the rules governing trade are", "start": 540.76, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "eroded", "start": 543.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "all of us will pay the price.", "start": 544.36, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "I know", "start": 548.28, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "that consensus amongst 193", "start": 549.6, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "states is difficult but it remains the", "start": 553.2, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "gold standard.", "start": 557.28, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "And I would ask all of you to recollect", "start": 559.0, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "the BBNJ agreement which entered into", "start": 561.76, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "force this year. This is clear evidence", "start": 564.4, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "that even in this time", "start": 568.88, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "we can still build common rules for", "start": 571.28, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "shared challenges and Singapore is proud", "start": 574.04, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "that our ambassador Vina Lee presided", "start": 577.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "over the negotiations that concluded", "start": 579.52, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "this agreement by consensus.", "start": 582.12, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "Having said that, even when consensus is", "start": 585.88, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "elusive,", "start": 588.64, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "we cannot allow collective action to be", "start": 590.16, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "held hostage or to be paralyzed.", "start": 592.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We need more flexible coalition of", "start": 596.04, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "states and partners", "start": 598.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "who are willing and able to move forward", "start": 600.16, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "whilst remaining open to others to join", "start": 602.76, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "when they are ready.", "start": 606.64, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Such coalitions already serve large and", "start": 608.24, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "small economies alike.", "start": 610.96, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "The RCEP, the Regional Comprehensive", "start": 613.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Economic Partnership,", "start": 615.44, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "is the largest trade agreement in the", "start": 617.44, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "world. The CPTPP, the Comprehensive and", "start": 619.96, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Progressive Trans-Pacific Partnership,", "start": 623.32, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "now stretches from Asia to Latin America", "start": 626.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "to the United Kingdom.", "start": 629.64, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "And in July, 19 small and medium-sized", "start": 631.56, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "trading nations of the Future of", "start": 635.36, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "Investment and Trade Partnership met in", "start": 637.6, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Auckland, not to negotiate a grand", "start": 639.56, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "bargain,", "start": 641.92, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "but to systematically reduce trade", "start": 643.04, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "frictions and to strengthen supply chain", "start": 645.64, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "resilience.", "start": 648.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Excellencies, this is not a retreat from", "start": 650.16, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "multilateralism. It is a pragmatic and", "start": 653.0, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "flexible effort to sustain cooperation", "start": 655.96, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "when broader agreement is not yet", "start": 659.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "possible", "start": 661.64, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "while remaining open", "start": 662.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "for those who are ready to join later", "start": 665.32, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "on.", "start": 668.4, "duration": 2.8}, {"text": "The objective remains the same: to", "start": 669.44, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "preserve the benefits of cooperation,", "start": 671.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "widen participation over time, and", "start": 673.28, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "ultimately bring these arrangements into", "start": 675.76, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "the multilateral global architecture.", "start": 678.68, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "Third,", "start": 682.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "we must collectively formulate new rules", "start": 683.2, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "and be prepared to create new", "start": 687.24, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "institutions if necessary for new", "start": 688.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "technologies.", "start": 691.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Artificial intelligence, which we've", "start": 693.0, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "heard so many times from the podium this", "start": 695.44, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "week, is arguably the most urgent", "start": 698.4, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "frontier.", "start": 702.12, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "AI offers with extraordinary potential,", "start": 703.56, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "but its capability is advancing faster", "start": 707.52, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "than our appreciation of its risks.", "start": 711.24, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "There are fundamentally three categories", "start": 714.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "of risk.", "start": 718.16, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "First, the loss of control of autonomous", "start": 719.68, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "systems. Second, that rogue actors", "start": 723.0, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "could use AI to create bio weapons or", "start": 727.16, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "other weapons of mass destruction or", "start": 730.0, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "mass disruption.", "start": 733.44, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "Third,", "start": 735.8, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "the economic, the social, the political,", "start": 736.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "domestic disruptions", "start": 740.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "are only just emerging.", "start": 742.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "But, excellencies, the genie is already", "start": 745.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "out of the bottle.", "start": 748.56, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "It is too late", "start": 750.24, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "to call for a halt,", "start": 751.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "especially given the superpower rivalry", "start": 753.88, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "and the huge financial incentives for", "start": 756.96, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "companies who already have frontier", "start": 761.12, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "models.", "start": 763.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "But, let me offer a metaphor", "start": 764.4, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "of driving a high-performance car.", "start": 767.44, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "To drive", "start": 770.28, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "a high-performance car quickly and", "start": 772.2, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "safely,", "start": 774.08, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "you need a powerful engine.", "start": 775.28, "duration": 3.559}, {"text": "But, equally,", "start": 777.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "you need good brakes. And, especially if", "start": 778.839, "duration": 5.321}, {"text": "you are going to go beyond your", "start": 782.6, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "neighborhood or cross boundaries, you", "start": 784.16, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "need effective shared rules, traffic", "start": 786.2, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "lights, insurance, norms of behavior,", "start": 788.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "seat belts.", "start": 791.4, "duration": 4.439}, {"text": "The engine is innovation. Every one of", "start": 793.2, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "us", "start": 795.839, "duration": 5.161}, {"text": "has to continue to invest in science,", "start": 797.52, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "the talent,", "start": 801.0, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "and the infrastructure that will drive", "start": 802.28, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "AI forward. For small states, this", "start": 804.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "entails especially developing our", "start": 806.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "people, equipping them with the skills", "start": 808.88, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "necessary to master and deploy AI", "start": 811.56, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "quickly, widely,", "start": 815.24, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "at scale, and safely.", "start": 817.48, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "The real productivity gains from AI", "start": 820.0, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "comes not from the IT department, but", "start": 823.44, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "from our businesses and workers having", "start": 826.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the skills, the tools, and the", "start": 829.64, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "wherewithal to engineer their work", "start": 832.36, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "processes workflow by workflow. It is", "start": 834.24, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "that's where the cutting edge of value", "start": 838.0, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "creation arises.", "start": 840.68, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "But, having said that,", "start": 843.32, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "every powerful engine needs good brakes,", "start": 845.12, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "safeguards. As the capabilities of AI", "start": 849.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "advance, our safeguards must keep pace.", "start": 852.4, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "We need rigorous testing and evaluation", "start": 856.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "before deployment. We need clear limits", "start": 859.08, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "on what autonomous systems can do,", "start": 862.08, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "and mecha- mechanisms to intervene when", "start": 864.56, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "they behave in ways we do not intend.", "start": 867.8, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "And since the risks from AI do not", "start": 871.92, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "remain confined behind borders, it means", "start": 875.32, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "we also need rules of the road that will", "start": 878.56, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "form a shared global understanding of", "start": 881.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "how we will collectively confront this", "start": 883.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "challenge. Just as all of us", "start": 886.48, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "instinctively understand traffic lights", "start": 889.56, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "the same way, whether we're here in New", "start": 891.64, "duration": 4.199}, {"text": "York or in Beijing,", "start": 893.32, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "Moscow, or Singapore.", "start": 895.839, "duration": 4.601}, {"text": "Most importantly,", "start": 898.64, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "human beings must ultimately remain in", "start": 900.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "control and accountable.", "start": 903.72, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "Let me give you an extreme thought", "start": 906.68, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "experiment.", "start": 908.839, "duration": 2.921}, {"text": "Do you want", "start": 910.36, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "the nuclear button", "start": 911.76, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "to be in the hands of a human being", "start": 913.6, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "or an AI?", "start": 916.12, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "Think about that.", "start": 917.72, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "The scarce resource today", "start": 919.64, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "is not legal architecture or technology.", "start": 922.72, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "It is trust.", "start": 926.52, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "Trust that the risk will be disclosed,", "start": 928.6, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "that testing will be comprehensive and", "start": 931.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "credible, and that cooperation will be", "start": 934.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "inclusive and not be used to secure", "start": 936.56, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "unilateral advantage. The technology has", "start": 939.92, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "already become an arena for strategic", "start": 943.16, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "competition, precisely when", "start": 945.24, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "international cooperation is most", "start": 947.2, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "needed.", "start": 949.6, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Any durable international approach must", "start": 950.96, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "give all stakes all stakes a meaningful", "start": 953.84, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "stake.", "start": 957.44, "duration": 2.84}, {"text": "Not only those", "start": 958.6, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "who already have the most advanced", "start": 960.28, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "models or the deepest pockets or the", "start": 961.92, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "largest set of armaments.", "start": 964.96, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "So, the question is how do we build", "start": 967.64, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "trust?", "start": 969.84, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "We begin with the science.", "start": 971.44, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "Even where states have differences on", "start": 973.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "governance, I believe it is possible for", "start": 976.28, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "us to work together", "start": 979.04, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "to collectively understand the", "start": 980.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "capabilities and risk of AI models, to", "start": 982.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "develop comparable methods for testing", "start": 985.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and evaluation, and to report serious", "start": 988.36, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "incidents", "start": 991.32, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "quickly across borders.", "start": 992.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We are not starting from zero.", "start": 995.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "If you", "start": 998.4, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "carefully go through what we already", "start": 999.72, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "have today, the UN's independent", "start": 1001.96, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "international scientific panel on AI", "start": 1005.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "already helps to establish a common", "start": 1008.04, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "understanding based on evidence.", "start": 1010.16, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "The global dialogue on AI governance can", "start": 1013.28, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "help to translate that common", "start": 1015.52, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "understanding into common objectives.", "start": 1017.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "And the ITU's AI for good global", "start": 1019.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "commission brings together leaders from", "start": 1022.12, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "government, industry, and", "start": 1024.0, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "international institutions to discuss", "start": 1025.8, "duration": 5.159}, {"text": "challenges and to come up with practical", "start": 1028.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "solutions. We must urgently establish", "start": 1030.959, "duration": 5.561}, {"text": "common rules and safeguards for AI, and", "start": 1034.199, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "we should build on the many ongoing", "start": 1036.52, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "discussions in different formats and", "start": 1039.0, "duration": 3.16}, {"text": "groupings.", "start": 1040.92, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "And here I want to make a point. The UN,", "start": 1042.16, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "the United Nations has a critical role", "start": 1045.4, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "to play in building convergence because", "start": 1048.04, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "this is the only apex international", "start": 1051.36, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "institution with universal membership.", "start": 1053.84, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "We must explore all options including", "start": 1057.48, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "the idea of a UN framework convention on", "start": 1061.04, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "AI safeguards.", "start": 1064.48, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "We may also need an international", "start": 1066.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "institution that can perform for AI some", "start": 1068.16, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "of the functions that currently exist", "start": 1070.92, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "for institutions that perform this this", "start": 1074.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "function of setting common technical", "start": 1078.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "standards. And the examples are the", "start": 1080.28, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "International Telecommunication Union", "start": 1082.56, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "which provides or the International", "start": 1085.6, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "Atomic A Energy Agency which provides", "start": 1088.04, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "verification. Ultimately the global", "start": 1091.48, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "commons are best protected by collective", "start": 1094.48, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "action agreed through an inclusive", "start": 1096.72, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "process. And Singapore commits to", "start": 1100.2, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "contribute where we can.", "start": 1103.28, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "This week we joined the call for greater", "start": 1105.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "safety and security of frontier AI", "start": 1107.88, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "models. And I'm glad that this was led", "start": 1110.32, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "by Finland and Norway.", "start": 1112.8, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "We will continue to contribute through", "start": 1114.96, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "platforms such as the digital pillar for", "start": 1117.24, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "the forum of small states and by making", "start": 1119.4, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "our governance frameworks and testing", "start": 1121.92, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "tools available to all.", "start": 1124.16, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "But the work of building trust and", "start": 1126.76, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "laying the ground for global cooperation", "start": 1129.16, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "must begin now.", "start": 1131.08, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "Ultimately", "start": 1133.44, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "powerful engines and good brakes and", "start": 1134.88, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "common rules", "start": 1137.32, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "do not stop us or slow us down.", "start": 1138.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "They give us the assurance and the", "start": 1141.92, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "confidence so that we can move faster", "start": 1143.44, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "and more effectively for the benefit of", "start": 1146.16, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "all our peoples.", "start": 1148.2, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Madam President, excellencies, effective", "start": 1150.4, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "multilateralism requires institutions", "start": 1153.28, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "that can deliver and that begins with a", "start": 1155.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "reform of the UN itself. I welcome the", "start": 1157.64, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "progress of the UN 80 initiative,", "start": 1160.2, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "but reform must be strategic, not merely", "start": 1163.04, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "not merely fiscal. Reform must", "start": 1165.76, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "strengthen the equal standing of all", "start": 1168.2, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "members.", "start": 1170.4, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "The goal is not a smaller UN for its own", "start": 1171.64, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "sake, but one that delivers better and", "start": 1174.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "more equitably.", "start": 1177.28, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "In this session, we will appoint the", "start": 1178.88, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "10th sec- Secretary-General of the UN.", "start": 1181.08, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "No one today under the age of 80 has", "start": 1184.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "lived in a world without the United", "start": 1187.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Nations. But the UN has to earn", "start": 1190.12, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the conf- confidence of successive", "start": 1193.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "generations.", "start": 1196.52, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "And it does this through what it", "start": 1198.12, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "delivers,", "start": 1200.16, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "not what it declares on paper.", "start": 1201.48, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "The next Secretary-General must lead a", "start": 1204.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "UN that turns multilateral cooperation", "start": 1206.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "into practical results", "start": 1208.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "and communicates these results in an", "start": 1211.04, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "effective way to all our people.", "start": 1213.04, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "Let me at this point also pay tribute to", "start": 1215.8, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Secretary-General Antonio Guterres.", "start": 1218.2, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "He's a good man with the courage of his", "start": 1220.88, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "convictions. And he has ably steered", "start": 1223.12, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "this organization through some very", "start": 1225.68, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "difficult years of global division. He", "start": 1228.36, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "has been a consistent voice for the", "start": 1231.64, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "charter, for our climate and oceans, and", "start": 1233.4, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "for the rules that hold the global", "start": 1236.16, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "commons together.", "start": 1237.84, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Finally, Madam President,", "start": 1239.8, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "effective multilateralism", "start": 1242.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "requires all countries to be prepared to", "start": 1244.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "contribute to the institutions that", "start": 1247.8, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "sustain it.", "start": 1249.72, "duration": 2.8}, {"text": "For Singapore, this begins with", "start": 1251.16, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "international law. The rule of law", "start": 1252.52, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "requires institutions to give it effect.", "start": 1254.8, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "Currently, the International Court of", "start": 1257.76, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "Justice has its fullest docket in its", "start": 1259.8, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "history.", "start": 1262.68, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "At precisely the moment when the", "start": 1263.84, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "relevance and effectiveness of", "start": 1265.56, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "international law is being questioned,", "start": 1267.24, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "states continue to bring their most", "start": 1269.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "serious disputes before the world's", "start": 1271.84, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "principal judicial organ. That's", "start": 1274.0, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "actually a good sign.", "start": 1276.32, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "That demonstrates trust in the peaceful", "start": 1278.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "settlement of disputes, and we must", "start": 1280.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "safeguard that trust.", "start": 1282.92, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "Singapore has nominated our ambassador", "start": 1285.12, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "for international law, Rena Lee, for", "start": 1287.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "election as a judge of the ICJ. And as a", "start": 1289.08, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "tiny small state, Singapore has been a", "start": 1292.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "beneficiary, has been an active", "start": 1294.96, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "practitioner, and a builder, a", "start": 1297.04, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "contributor to international law. We now", "start": 1298.72, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "ask for the chance to serve the cause of", "start": 1301.6, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "the rule of law.", "start": 1304.2, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "Madam President,", "start": 1305.88, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "this is the case for multilateralism.", "start": 1307.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "It's not some pie-in-the-sky", "start": 1311.52, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "idealism,", "start": 1314.0, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "but a hard-headed recognition that", "start": 1315.48, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "cooperation ultimately serves all of us.", "start": 1318.16, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "For every state, large or small,", "start": 1322.04, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "a world governed by rules is infinitely", "start": 1325.56, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "better", "start": 1328.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "than one governed simply by the exercise", "start": 1329.96, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "of hard, crude power.", "start": 1333.04, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "In 1945, the founders of the UN hoped", "start": 1336.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "that the rules", "start": 1339.8, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "could restrain power.", "start": 1341.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "If we want to keep that hope alive, we", "start": 1343.32, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "must defend those very same rules that", "start": 1346.32, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "continue to serve us consistently", "start": 1349.44, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "everywhere across the globe.", "start": 1352.64, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "We have to adapt to a changing world,", "start": 1355.4, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "and we have to build new rules, new", "start": 1358.4, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "institutions, and new processes where", "start": 1360.56, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the challenges demand.", "start": 1362.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Thank you all very much.", "start": 1364.96, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": ">> [applause]", "start": 1368.965, "duration": 2.02}, {"text": ">> I thank the Foreign Minister of", "start": 1376.24, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "Singapore for his presentation.", "start": 1379.76, "duration": 4.32}]